---
description: Rails 8 conventions for the sample todo app
alwaysApply: true
---

- Prefer Turbo Streams over custom JavaScript for partial page updates
- Keep all migrations reversible (use reversible block or up/down methods)
- Always use strong parameters in controllers
- Use bin/rails generate rather than hand-writing boilerplate
- Keep schema scoped to the todo app; do not import models or migrations from other projects
- Partials go in app/views/shared/ for shared content or app/views/<resource>/ for resource-specific
- Controllers respond with HTML by default; only add format.turbo_stream when a Turbo Stream response is needed
- Follow RESTful routing conventions; avoid custom routes unless necessary
